loads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%8C%E7%94%9F%E8%88%9E%E4%BC%B6\" title=\"双生舞伶\"><img alt=\"双生舞伶\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-314901.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-314901.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-314901.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%8C%E7%94%9F%E8%88%9E%E4%BC%B6\" title=\"双生舞伶\">双生舞伶</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>S02</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>装置式未来</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：314903</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3149/314903/双子-1技能组.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3149/314903/双子-1技能组 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3149/314903/双子-2技能组.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3149/314903/双子-2技能组 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3149/314903/7月20日 (2).mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3149/314903/双子-大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3149/314903/双子-入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3149/314903/双子-入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">玛雅·普丽谢斯卡娅剧院灯光如水，《天鹅湖》组曲响起，双簧管柔和、忧伤的曲调缓缓流淌。又是场一票难求的演出，手眼通天的权贵与顶尖的艺术家都排着队等候欣赏这对机械芭蕾舞姬。双生舞伶早已候在台下，魅惑如奥吉利亚，纯洁如奥杰塔。她们熟悉这一切，如同熟悉自己的仿生义体和护甲。<br />舞剧优雅华美，作为3826号设施的代表，双生舞伶的动作一如既往精准无比——自诞生起，她们体内便储存了许多经典芭蕾剧目。金属质感的羽毛簌簌抖动，锋利明锐的舞裙随着32圈挥鞭转流光溢彩。意识里似乎有一滴不知来自何处的泪珠，轻盈而温柔。但芭蕾战斗机器人怎么会因《天鹅湖》的终幕产生“悲伤”的情感呢？她们只需要旋转、再旋转。<br />在谢幕的灯光下，双生舞伶微微偏头，对这种陌生的情绪感到困惑。<br />而台下掌声雷动，又一场完美的演出。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"314903\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-314904.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e1/Belonging-314904.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“双生”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Binary Feathers\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />3<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>以天鹅舒展的翅膀为原型的头饰，纤薄的合金上涂有模仿鸟羽光泽的偏光涂料。<br />当受访者展示其可动性时，笔者发现这些羽毛的边缘锋利如手术刀。看来，这一对优雅的天鹅绝不需要等待某位王子的拯救。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-314905.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8f/Belonging-314905.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">新材料与构成主义<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">New Material &amp; Constructivism</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />36<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>恐怕没有任何一位血肉之身的舞者，能够穿上这样一身柔韧却锋利的舞裙。独树一帜的航空合金材质与3826号设施的科技，造就了这对永远挺括的演出服、雕塑与可遥控式冷兵器。<br />是的，芭蕾战斗机器人永远以战斗能力为最高优先级。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-314906.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d9/Belonging-314906.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">阿尔法连接器<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Alpha Connector</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一枚正式名为阿尔法连接器的钥匙，具备令人浮想联翩的功用，似乎能够开启一个秘密、一个阴谋、一个潘多拉魔盒……<br />至于这枚钥匙具体释放之物的信息，因保密权限太高，受访者拒绝对外开放。</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table zh-only\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/107px-Tupo_xindiantu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/161px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/214px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"740\" data-file-height=\"208\" /></td><th>EN</th><th>中</th><th class=\"not-zh\">日</th><th class=\"not-zh\">한</th><th>文本</th></tr><tr><th>入队</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero314903_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314903_fightingvoc_55\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10